{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch1Sp4m17BirgMBPNqqF6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked all ten items in the browser and they pass. The shop refresh button had already been written before the interruption and works correctly. `check_engine.js` passes in full, and `pack.js` builds the single-file version (`原型/v1.7/index.packed.html`), which opens by double-click with all 162 images and no errors. As you asked, I didn't commit or push, even though `CLAUDE.md` normally says to.\n\n**What I changed this session:**\n- **Card info popup:** it now shows the card name, e.g. \"长腔 · 台上面\" / \"倾听 · 家里面\". It already showed what the card does and how much gold it earns.\n- **`check_engine.js`:** added tests for the 灯油 item (an unmet need only dims the lamp by 1) and for the box-size rule (`max(6, 10 − floor(底色/2))` from day 4, 妆奁 +1, and the in-game box size following 底色).\n- **`pack.js`:** it was crashing because the five new items have no art yet. It now builds correctly.\n- **Version and README:** the page title now says v1.7. The README's v1.7 lines described an older plan and had the wrong save name (`dise-v14`); I corrected them to this version (`dise-v17`). The v1.6 instructions are untouched.\n\n**Browser check results** (desktop, low, narrow, phone portrait, phone landscape and small phone; phone sizes tested with touch):\n- **Shop refresh:** costs 3 gold (30 → 27), replaces the stock, and after use shows \"今天已经换过一批了\". Buying after a refresh works (bought 慢板, 27 → 19, card added to the deck).\n- **No blocking:** event cards, chat bubbles, card info, combo banners and wipe buttons never overlap the hand or main buttons on any screen size.\n- **Tap and drag:** a tap shows card info without changing the box, and tapping empty space closes it. Dragging back to the hand doesn't play the card; dragging onto the stage does.\n- **Wipe count:** the door button reads \"剩 1/2 次\". After wiping, 